---
// Hero.astro: split homepage hero. The dark panel on the left carries the
// rating pill, headline, description, CTAs and phone line. The cream panel on
// the right holds an example message thread with Chris. Swap the placeholder
// thread below for a real (anonymised, with permission) exchange when you have one.
---

<section class="hero-v2 hero-split">
  <div class="hero-split-left">
    <div class="hero-v2-left hero-split-content">
      <a href="https://share.google/HmqVC5OhdKakcRtS4" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hero-v2-rating">
        <span class="hero-v2-rating-stars" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</span>
        <span class="hero-v2-rating-text"><strong>5.0</strong> on Google<span class="hero-v2-rating-extra"> · clients love working with me</span></span>
      </a>
      <h1 class="hero-v2-headline">
        A WordPress site<br />
        <span class="accent">you never have to<br />worry about</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-v2-desc">
        I handle the updates, backups and security for a fixed monthly fee, so
        your site stays fast and safe and you can get on with running your
        business.
      </p>
      <!--<ul class="hero-v2-stats">
        <li><span class="stat-tick" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><strong>4 years</strong> avg. client relationship</li>
        <li><span class="stat-tick" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><strong>&lt;1 hour</strong> response time</li>
        <li><span class="stat-tick" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><strong>0</strong> security breaches</li>
        <li><span class="stat-tick" aria-hidden="true">✓</span><strong>NI</strong> based &amp; direct access</li>
      </ul>-->
      <div class="hero-v2-cta-row">
        <a href="#contact" class="hero-v2-cta-primary">
          Get a free site health check
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2.5" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 13.5 12 21m0 0-7.5-7.5M12 21V3" /></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="#clients" class="hero-v2-cta-secondary">See my work</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-v2-phone">
        Prefer to talk? <a href="tel:+447440018091">07440 018091</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-split-right">
    <div class="hero-chat" role="group" aria-label="Example of a message exchange with a client">
      <div class="hero-chat-bar">
        <span class="hero-chat-avatar" aria-hidden="true">C</span>
        <div class="hero-chat-who">
          <span class="hero-chat-name">Chris</span>
          <span class="hero-chat-sub">WP Base</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-chat-thread">
        <div class="hero-chat-msg hero-chat-msg--client">
          <p>Hi Chris, my phone is showing a security warning when I open our website. Have we been hacked?</p>
          <span class="hero-chat-time">09:12</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-chat-msg hero-chat-msg--chris">
          <p>Not hacked. Your SSL certificate expired overnight. I've renewed it, so have another look and the warning should be gone.</p>
          <span class="hero-chat-time">09:16</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-chat-msg hero-chat-msg--client">
          <p>All fine now. Thanks, that was quick!</p>
          <span class="hero-chat-time">09:17</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-v2-phone {
    margin-block: 1.25rem 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
  }

  .hero-v2-phone a {
    color: var(--snow);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .hero-v2-phone a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .hero-chat {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 30rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    background: var(--midnight);
    color: var(--snow);
    border-radius: 2px;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(8, 12, 24, 0.25);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-chat-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }

  .hero-chat-avatar {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 2.25rem;
    height: 2.25rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--midnight);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .hero-chat-who {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .hero-chat-name {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .hero-chat-sub {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
  }

  .hero-chat-thread {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.9rem;
    padding: 1.5rem 1.25rem 1.75rem;
  }

  .hero-chat-msg {
    max-width: 85%;
    padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .hero-chat-msg p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .hero-chat-msg--client {
    align-self: flex-start;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
    border-bottom-left-radius: 2px;
  }

  .hero-chat-msg--chris {
    align-self: flex-end;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--midnight);
    border-bottom-right-radius: 2px;
  }

  .hero-chat-time {
    display: block;
    margin-block-start: 0.3rem;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    text-align: right;
    opacity: 0.65;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .hero-chat-msg {
      animation: hero-chat-in 0.45s ease-out both;
    }

    .hero-chat-msg:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
    .hero-chat-msg:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 1.2s; }
    .hero-chat-msg:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 2.1s; }
  }

  @keyframes hero-chat-in {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(8px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }
</style>
